     settings (SettingsActivity) and the controls over other apps
     (Overlays). Every string is in values-b+zh+Hans and values-ja too, and
     the wording follows desktop Pinky's (cmd/pinky/locales: ask*,
     settingsAsk*, needs*). Release builds do not show these screens yet
     (on_phone_ui). -->
