    <string name="phone_sched_note">Pinky runs a scheduled task while this phone is unlocked and you haven\'t touched it for a minute. With the background screen set up (Settings › Background screen), it also runs one while the phone is locked. It never unlocks the phone or turns its screen on: otherwise it skips the time and tells you. A scheduled task never pays, and a step that needs your approval waits for you with a notification.</string>
